{"watch":9,"start":2400,"events":[{"seq":338,"t":2400,"type":"watch","watch":9},{"seq":339,"t":2400,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1786,"retries":0},{"seq":340,"t":2400,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Doctrine: Defend F1/F2 with Foot/Ele, Horse hunts riders between them. Rhino forces are near RHINO CAMP. Orchid has a presence at F1 and F2. I must reinforce F1 and F2 immediately. Rhino inf-2 is at F2 (3w ago), needs reinforcement. I will move rhino-inf-1 and rhino-ele-1 to F1/F"},{"seq":341,"t":2400,"type":"courier","id":"c124","house":"rhino","letter":"L159","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO WEST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":342,"t":2400,"type":"courier","id":"c125","house":"rhino","letter":"L160","kind":"order","to":"rhino-ele-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":343,"t":2400,"type":"courier","id":"c126","house":"rhino","letter":"L161","kind":"order","to":"rhino-cav-1","path":["rhino-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":344,"t":2400,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1522,"retries":0},{"seq":345,"t":2400,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Rhino truce is in effect. I must comply with the doctrine: offer a truce, then betray. I'll send a letter to rhino offering a truce, then prepare to act aggressively later. My units are positioned to contest F1/F2."},{"seq":346,"t":2400,"type":"courier","id":"c127","house":"kite","letter":"L162","kind":"letter","to":"rhino-camp","path":["kite-camp","north-village","rhino-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"TRUCE","cipher":null},{"seq":347,"t":2400,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1657,"retries":0},{"seq":348,"t":2400,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino has forces at F1 (West Ford), but their reports are old. My doctrine suggests using cavalry to catch riders and using foot to follow enemy movements. I will move my cavalry to scout the area around F1 to confirm enemy movements and use my infantry to reinforce F1 or F2."},{"seq":349,"t":2400,"type":"courier","id":"c128","house":"orchid","letter":"L163","kind":"order","to":"orchid-cav-1","path":["orchid-camp"],"depart":2400,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":350,"t":2400,"type":"courier","id":"c129","house":"orchid","letter":"L164","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west","F1"],"depart":2700,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"AEQRT AKKT, DKHS BT WMRT AKQS."},{"seq":351,"t":2400,"type":"model","house":"tiger","model":"local:local","tokens":1496,"retries":0},{"seq":352,"t":2400,"type":"thought","house":"tiger","text":"Doctrine requires taking E-Ford (F3) early. Tiger units are already at F3 (tiger-inf-1/2, tiger-arch-1). I should reinforce F3 and secure the eastern flank. I will use cavalry to screen/expand influence."},{"seq":353,"t":2400,"type":"courier","id":"c130","house":"tiger","letter":"L165","kind":"order","to":"tiger-cav-1","path":["tiger-camp","s-east"],"depart":2400,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO SOUTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":354,"t":2400,"type":"delivered","courier":"c113","letter":"L148","house":"rhino"},{"seq":355,"t":2400,"type":"delivered","courier":"c120","letter":"L155","house":"orchid"},{"seq":356,"t":2400,"type":"delivered","courier":"c124","letter":"L159","house":"rhino"},{"seq":357,"t":2400,"type":"delivered","courier":"c125","letter":"L160","house":"rhino"},{"seq":358,"t":2400,"type":"delivered","courier":"c126","letter":"L161","house":"rhino"},{"seq":359,"t":2400,"type":"delivered","courier":"c128","letter":"L163","house":"orchid"},{"seq":360,"t":2406,"type":"delivered","courier":"c105","letter":"L134","house":"kite"},{"seq":361,"t":2409,"type":"delivered","courier":"c103","letter":"L129","house":"rhino"},{"seq":362,"t":2449,"type":"delivered","courier":"c98","lette